  {
    "label": "all-three-field-identical-305",
    "sql": "select * from corpus_segments where acip=? and wylie=? and english=? order by course,seq",
    "parameters": [
      "YI DVAGS LA YANG LTO BSREG PA SOGS DNGOS GNAS PA MED PAR THAL, DE YI DVAGS RANG GI BLOS RLOM PA TZAM YIN PA'I PHYIR, 'DOD NA, YI DVAGS KYI SDUG BSNGAL MED PAR THAL,",
      "yi dvags la yang lto bsreg pa sogs dngos gnas pa med par thal, de yi dvags rang gi blos rlom pa tsam yin pa'i phyir, 'dod na, yi dvags kyi sdug bsngal med par thal",
      "Are you saying then that when the pus and blood sizzle in the stomach of the craving spirit, and so on, it can't be something real? For that too is nothing more than his own imagination. You agree? Well then, the suffering of craving spirits must not exist at all."
    ],
